# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Edge proxy for the whole VPS (see ../docker-compose.yml).
#
# This file holds only what must be global. Every site lives in its own file
# under sites/, owned by that project's deploy:
#   sites/toolsman.caddy        toolsman.co.ke, www, pos.toolsman.co.ke
#   sites/ciss-solutions.caddy  cisssolutions.co.ke, www
#   sites/ciss-pos.caddy        pos.cisssolutions.co.ke
# After changing a site file:
#   docker exec edge-caddy caddy validate --config /etc/caddy/Caddyfile --adapter caddyfile
#   docker exec edge-caddy caddy reload   --config /etc/caddy/Caddyfile --adapter caddyfile
#
# Real visitor IP behind Cloudflare (used by toolsman's rate limiting): Caddy
# believes a forwarded client address only from Cloudflare's ranges, and takes
# it from CF-Connecting-IP. Ranges from https://www.cloudflare.com/ips/
# (checked 2026-09-29).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
